This file is the single index of third-party content that Rumoca either
redistributes in this repository or embeds in the binaries it publishes. It
has two parts: the Rust crates statically linked into the published binaries
(reproduced in full below), and the other third-party content in this
repository (indexed under "Other third-party content"). The authoritative text
for each entry is the license named in that entry.

The published `rumoca` and `rumoca-lsp` binaries embed the code of the crates
listed here, and every license listed here conditions redistribution on its
notice being reproduced. Reproducing them, alongside the binary, is what
discharges that condition. This file is attached to every GitHub Release next
to the binaries.

The crate set is the workspace's default-feature runtime dependency graph
resolved over every published target. That is a superset of what any single
binary links, because a crate reachable only from another workspace member is
listed too. Over-attribution costs nothing; under-attribution is the failure
mode this file exists to prevent.

The file is generated, not hand-written. Regenerate it with
`cargo xtask licenses`; the crate set and the accepted-license policy are
in `infra/licenses/about.toml`. Do not edit this file directly.

